          ],
          "bullets": [
            "Meta's consumer AI agent Muse can now place calls to US businesses on behalf of its users, but only paid subscribers have access, TechCrunch reports. The feature was first tested in September with a select number of early adopters who asked for access.",
            "Muse subscription plans start at $20 per month for 500 million Muse tokens per week, with a $100 per month tier for 3 billion tokens. Meta said last month that Muse has over 10 million users.",
