        { "host": "A", "text": "Companies never see the footage. It sits encrypted with a cloud service outside Ukraine and they run models against it in an isolated system." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "One executive whose model is now flying in combat said training statistics showed false positives below 5 percent, but spoke anonymously under a secrecy agreement, so there's no way to check that. This is a single source, and the archive counts come from the ministry itself." }
