        { "host": "B", "text": "What's the scale?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Developed on a UK Biobank cohort of 320,891 participants, then validated externally on 4,728,376 people in UK primary care records." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And it holds up?" },
